# Files the generator must not overwrite. Everything not listed here — lib/,
# build.yaml, README.md — is regenerated wholesale on every run.

# Hand-owned: the template claims an SDK floor nothing here tests, pins a `test`
# dev-dependency for tests this repository does not generate, and writes the
# description into a single-quoted YAML scalar without escaping, so an
# apostrophe produces a manifest pub cannot parse.
pubspec.yaml

# Hand-owned: holds the relaxations the templates' own output requires. The
# generator would overwrite them on every run.
analysis_options.yaml

# The repository root has one, and it already covers this package's build
# artefacts. The template's version would add nothing and drift on its own.
.gitignore

.travis.yml
git_push.sh
test/
doc/
README.md
